---
import ResearchFigureFrame from './ResearchFigureFrame.astro';
---

<ResearchFigureFrame
  eyebrow="Current human-authored workflow"
  title="Route, then narrow"
  caption="Selection bounds the present task. Other project memory remains available for other work; the repository does not currently detect relevance automatically."
>
  <div class="routing-flow">
    <section>
      <span class="label">Task</span>
      <strong>Change publication behavior</strong>
      <p>The task supplies scope, not every document in the repository.</p>
    </section>

    <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>

    <section class="router">
      <span class="label">Explicit routing</span>
      <code>AGENTS.md</code>
      <p>Read the constitution, then the relevant spec, plan/tasks, and ADRs before structural changes.</p>
    </section>

    <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>

    <section class="selected">
      <span class="label">Selected context</span>
      <ol>
        <li><span>01</span>Project-wide factual guardrails</li>
        <li><span>02</span>Publication-gating specification and decisions</li>
        <li><span>03</span>Relevant implementation surfaces</li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </div>

  <p class="routing-note"><strong>Boundary:</strong> a human-authored entry point and task scope guide selection today. Automated relevance detection is not implemented.</p>
</ResearchFigureFrame>

<style>
  .routing-flow {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding: 1rem 0;
  }

  section {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .label,
  code,
  li span,
  .routing-note strong {
    font-family: var(--font-mono-ui);
  }

  .label {
    display: block;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  section > strong,
  code {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  code {
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  section p,
  .routing-note {
    margin: 0.45rem 0 0 !important;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .router {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
    padding-left: 0.8rem;
  }

  .arrow {
    align-self: center;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono-ui);
    text-align: center;
    transform: rotate(90deg);
  }

  ol {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    margin: 0.65rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.8rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  li span {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.625rem;
  }

  .routing-note {
    margin-top: 0.75rem !important;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-subtle);
    padding-top: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .routing-note strong {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  @media (min-width: 820px) {
    .routing-flow {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 2rem minmax(0, 1.1fr) 2rem minmax(0, 1.15fr);
      align-items: center;
    }

    .arrow {
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>
